OL,3,GNEWSAWarwick Castle worker lifts lid on
OL,4,Auntold haunting tales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA staff member at Warwick Castle has
OL,7,Fturned ghost hunter after hearing so
OL,8,Fmany eerie tales from colleagues that
OL,9,Fhe decided to investigate them himself.
OL,11,FJames Bryan, living in Coventry, has
OL,12,Flaunched a podcast featuring
OL,13,Fnever-before-told stories from staff
OL,14,Fwho claim to have experienced strange
OL,15,Fhappenings behind the walls of one of
OL,16,Fthe Midlands' most famous historic
OL,17,Fattractions.
OL,19,F"It got to the point where I thought,
OL,20,Fif so many people are saying the same
OL,21,Fthing, what is going on here?" he said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
