OL,3,GNEWSAWarwick Castle worker lifts lid on
OL,4,Auntold haunting tales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBryan was inspired to start The
OL,7,FHauntings of Warwick Castle podcast
OL,8,Fafter feeling what he described as
OL,9,Fsomeone tugging at his clothing while
OL,10,Fhe was working in the castle's dungeon.
